{"event_type":"finding-event","id":"e95e352bb071b12b46bf7921137e9c305e76a310a016d3fcbeaaf7b8826aa1e9","occurred_at":"2026-11-22T09:59:16Z","payload":{"action":"confirmed","actor":"crq-triage/opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash","evidence":{"anchor_verified":true,"failure_class":"evidence","mapped_intervals":[[99,102]],"mapped_path":"apps/crq-python/ops/unit-live-binding.py","quoted_text":"DEPENDENCY_RE = re.compile(\n    r\"(?P<directive>Wants|Requires|Requisite|BindsTo|PartOf|Conflicts|\"\n    r\"WantedBy|RequiredBy|Also|Upholds|OnFailure|OnSuccess|Triggers|\"\n    r\"TriggersBy|Unit|Service)\\s*=\\s*(?P<value>.*)\")","reason":"The dependency regex enumerates [Unit] directives but omits systemd v257 stop-propagation directives StopPropagatedFrom= and PropagatesStopTo=. Those directives make a stop propagate between the CRQ unit and a co-installed unit, so the live-binding dependency scan can miss a unit affected by the fence and wrongly vouch for the binding. Adding both names to the directive alternation is a routine correctness fix.","target":"fdf8d470f0eb1c53065cc9d815b366b6f4c2e41e"},"finding_id":"c7b77c93896633be5163f44f39c7843bb564e25079db60acbfaa86176229b442","previous_event_id":"1a4784889d81cd79a1f9768648c2f4ace11a14d2bd6675fe3c25a4dca7fd6766","review_id":"b08452801c153d71823e0063057ca8526a7754e9b9085e055e498d2c928878b1"},"schema":"cq.review-ledger/v1","source_key":"finding:c7b77c93896633be5163f44f39c7843bb564e25079db60acbfaa86176229b442:202125b9733ccb085c67d4dd14eeff37bda4f6d5e36275a36d3fd80e38431e73"}